<h1>K-Scan Localisers</h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Please refer the K-CMM documentation for more information. The K-CMM software package comes with one manual. It is delivered in a paper and an electronic version.</p>
<p>To open the electronic version of the manual, just click with the left mouse button on the [<span style="font-style:italic;"><i>K-CMM Manual</i></span>] toolbar icon ( <img src="manual_icon.gif" width="31px" height="32px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">) of the <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>K-CMM Control</i></span> toolbar:</p>
<p><img src="KCMM_toolbar.jpg" width="713px" height="66px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>The installed PDF reader will open the corresponding manual with the chosen language:</p>
<p><img src="KScan_Manual.gif" width="679px" height="863px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
